#!/bin/sh
# yabi demo: the splash stays up at 100%, try the commands
[ "$1" = start ] || exit 0
cat <<'MSG'

  Boot complete, the splash is at 100%. Try, in this console:

    yabi progress 30      move the progress bar
    yabi theme default    switch theme on the fly
    yabi pause / resume   stop and restart the animation
    yabi status           frame, frame count, pause state
    yabi rc               run the boot scripts again
    yabi quit             close the splash

  Quit QEMU with Ctrl-a x.

MSG
